				<li><a href="https://alistapart.com/article/a-pixel-identity-crisis" target="_blank">“A Pixel Identity Crisis”</a> — A List Apart <em>2012</em></li>
			</ul>

			<a href="/scott-kellum-resume.docx" class="cta">Download Résumé</a>

